#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:9
msgid ""
"人形机械臂ART7-R7共有四种配置：配置一为单臂，配置二为单臂+控制器，配置三为双臂，配置四为双臂+控制器+分支器。如图2-1、2-2、2-3和2-4所示。到货之后，请依照装箱清单确认装箱物品。"
msgstr ""
"The humanoid robotic arm ART7-R7 has four configurations: Configuration 1 is"
" a single arm, Configuration 2 is a single arm + controller, Configuration 3"
" is dual arms, and Configuration 4 is dual arms + controller + splitter. As "
"shown in Figures 2-1, 2-2, 2-3, and 2-4. Upon delivery, please verify the "
"contents against the packing list."

