#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:36
msgid "搬运"
msgstr "Repost"

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:43
msgid "名称：**危险**"
msgstr "Name:**Danger**"

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:45
#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:57
msgid "说明："
msgstr "Note:"

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:47
msgid "请在机械臂外围设置安全栏，安全栏应具备不易翻越、移动的特点。否则，作业人员可能在机械臂动作时进入区域，导致人员受伤，设备受损。"
msgstr ""
"Please install safety barriers around the robotic arm, and the barriers "
"should be difficult to climb over or move. Otherwise, operators may enter "
"the area while the robotic arm is in operation, resulting in personal injury"
" and equipment damage."

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:48
msgid "请明确标识机械臂动作区域。"
msgstr "Please clearly mark the operating area of the robotic arm."

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:55
msgid "名称：**警告**"
msgstr "Name:**Warning**"

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:59
msgid "使用吊车、叉车等搬运机械臂，必须由持有操作资格证的人员或经公司允许的人员进行。否则，机械臂在搬运中有可能掉落，从而导致事故。"
msgstr ""
"The transportation of robotic arms using cranes, forklifts, and other "
"handling equipment must be carried out by personnel holding valid operation "
"qualification certificates or those authorized by the company. Otherwise, "
"the robotic arms may fall during transportation, resulting in accidents."

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:60
msgid "机械臂安装后，要确保机械臂完全展开时，其腕部工具或工件尖端不会碰触到墙壁或安全栏。否则，可能导致人员受伤，设备受损。"
msgstr ""
"After the robotic arm is installed, ensure that when the robotic arm is "
"fully extended, its wrist tool or the tip of the workpiece does not come "
"into contact with walls or safety barriers. Otherwise, this may result in "
"personal injury or equipment damage."

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:61
msgid "必须将机械臂固定好之后，再接通电源，启动机械臂。 否则，机械臂有倾倒风险，可能导致人员受伤，设备受损。"
msgstr ""
"The robotic arm must be securely fixed before powering on and starting it."
"   Otherwise, there is a risk of the robotic arm tipping over, potentially "
"causing personal injury and equipment damage."

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:62
msgid "请不要运行零部件缺失或损坏的机械臂，否则，机械臂误动作，可能导致人员受伤，设备受损。"
msgstr ""
"Do not operate the robotic arm with missing or damaged components; "
"otherwise, unexpected movements of the robotic arm may result in personal "
"injury or equipment damage."

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:63
msgid "搬运过程中，请避免过度震动和冲击。否则，将影响机械臂性能。"
msgstr ""
"During handling, please avoid excessive vibration and impact. Otherwise, it "
"will affect the performance of the robotic arm."

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:65
msgid ""
"人形机械臂ART7-R7产品（含包装）总质量约为20⁓39kg，需多人协作抬起，不建议单人操作，以免发生意外。长途运输前请将机械臂调整至规定的装箱姿势，并使用专用纸箱包装后运输。"
msgstr ""
"The total mass of the humanoid robotic arm ART7-R7 product (including "
"packaging) is approximately 20⁓39kg, requiring multiple people to lift it "
"together, and single-person operation is not recommended to avoid accidents."
" Before long-distance transportation, please adjust the robotic arm to the "
"specified packing position, and pack it in a dedicated carton for "
"transportation."

