#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:122
msgid "存放场所与使用环境"
msgstr "Storage Location and Operating Environment"

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:125
msgid "存放场所"
msgstr "Storage Location"

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:127
msgid "人形机械臂ART7-R7应在-20~60℃，无凝霜环境下存放。"
msgstr ""
"The humanoid robotic arm ART7-R7 should be stored in -20~60℃, in a "
"condensation-free and frost-free environment."

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:130
msgid "使用环境"
msgstr "Operating Environment"

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:131
msgid "安装机械臂的场所需要满足以下条件："
msgstr ""
"The installation site for the robotic arm must meet the following "
"conditions:"

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:133
msgid "机械臂运转时，周围温度应在0°C~45°C以内；"
msgstr ""
"When the robotic arm is operating, the ambient temperature should be within "
"0°C~45°C;"

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:134
msgid "湿度小、较干燥(工作湿度90%RH，无凝露)；"
msgstr ""
"Low humidity, relatively dry(operating humidity90%RH，no condensation)；"

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:135
msgid "不会受到较大冲击和震动；"
msgstr "will not be subjected to significant impact and vibration;"

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:136
msgid "远离灰尘、粉尘、金属粉、腐蚀性气体、易燃性气体、油雾等；"
msgstr ""
"Keep away from dust, powder, metal powder, corrosive gases, flammable gases,"
" oil mist, etc.;"

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:137
msgid "远离强磁场、远离电气干扰源等；"
msgstr ""
"Keep away from strong magnetic fields, keep away from electrical "
"interference sources, etc.;"

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:139
msgid "环境温度条件仅为机械臂适用条件。若要在不符合上述条件的场所使用，请咨询本公司。"
msgstr ""
"The ambient temperature conditions apply solely to the robotic arm. For use "
"in locations that do not meet the above conditions, please consult our "
"company."

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:142
msgid "启用"
msgstr "Enable"

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:143
msgid ""
"在产品安装和使用前，客户必须针对具体应用场景进行全面的安全评估，重点关注剩余风险因素，并依据本手册对软硬件进行相应的安全配置。首次启动机械臂时，务必密切观察其运动空间，确保无任何干涉或障碍。"
msgstr ""
"Before product installation and use, customers must conduct a comprehensive "
"safety assessment for specific application scenarios, focusing on residual "
"risk factors, and perform corresponding safety configurations for the "
"software and hardware in accordance with this manual. When starting the "
"robotic arm for the first time, it is imperative to closely monitor its "
"workspace to ensure there is no interference or obstruction."

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:145
msgid "使用机械臂前，请确认机械臂零点姿态与图2-8和图2-9所示姿态一致。若机械臂未移动到图示位置，请咨询本公司。"
msgstr ""
"Before using the robotic arm, please confirm that the zero pose of the "
"robotic arm is consistent with the poses shown in Figure 2-8 and Figure 2-9."
" If the robotic arm has not moved to the illustrated position, please "
"contact our company."

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:147
msgid "机械臂在出厂时，已经进行零点标定，所以在日常操作中不需要进行零点标定。但发生下述情况后需要进行零点标定。"
msgstr ""
"The robotic arm has already been zero-calibrated at the factory, so zero "
"calibration is not required during daily operations. However, zero "
"calibration is required after the following situations occur."

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:149
msgid "更换了关节驱动器或机械臂关节；"
msgstr "Replaced the joint actuator or robotic arm joint;"

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:150
msgid "重新安装系统或更换控制器；"
msgstr "Reinstall the system or replace the controller;"

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:151
msgid "发生剧烈碰撞后。"
msgstr "After a violent collision."

#: ../../source/ART7Manual/art_begin.rst:153
msgid "机械臂各轴零点标定位置如图2-10和2-11所示。"
msgstr ""
"The zero-point calibration positions for each axis of the robotic arm are "
"shown in Figures 2-10 and 2-11."

